{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f4229cff3e2de5cf1d578f03173cc300595fbb3381af97b70b6c20c68808f56a","ja":"ごめんなさい！　たまきたち、ちょっと遅れちゃった\n……あれっ？","zh":"对不起！环她们稍微迟到了一点\n……咦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"78faf38a221ba62ce19950abea42a5499e1f8f6e37fb49a5e3b292616a9e80b0","ja":"じゅりあもかおりも、いないぞ……？","zh":"茱莉亚和歌织都不在啊……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"a124350cacd360aa49f656079d5e466ce16a92d3950239f68abf42b5a596321c","ja":"あっ、歌織さんからだ！　もしもし！","zh":"啊，是歌织小姐打来的！喂喂！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"89ce9ddf82471723dd2cd6ccadbf4eeb6f7fc80f8c1a57c17640c5a14a48a099","ja":"「さっきはお電話、出れなくてごめんなさい。\nなにかあったの？」","zh":"“刚才没能接您的电话，真不好意思。\n请问有什么事吗？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6644e0471dff94a0cf00ad02eb69cf9e0daf632e572da7a3fd19ae5dbc20c209","ja":"う、うん。それより、打ち合わせに来れなくなったの？\nわたしたち、もうレッスンルームに来てるんだけど。","zh":"嗯、嗯。比起这个，你来不了碰头会了吗？\n我们已经到练习室了哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d5ae1a30a983cf7bd07bb8b13116cf6ef1de9bdd6d86de006db3cb08ce063ad1","ja":"「えっ……たしか今日の打ち合わせって、4時から、\nドレスアップルームに集合じゃなかったかしら？」","zh":"「咦……我记得今天的碰头会，不是4点在\n更衣室集合吗？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9ec79b0f596a41240c2b711c5265ba8d3f3953be79b99f00b7ad802a64be8135","ja":"ええ～～っ！？","zh":"诶诶～～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2","ja":"1時間後……","zh":"一个小时后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"50fabeeb7d7671343533875dcb1cd21d79933a0e073a49ba2d9f88c84bb5a20b","ja":"前の仕事が早めに終わって良かったよ。\n……ところで、どうして衣装に着替えてるんだ？","zh":"之前的工作能提早结束真是太好了。\n……话说回来，你怎么换上演出服装了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"8e99276e1059089edc06d4c155a2126aee64ec0c2e272691b5afe7c59cecca92","ja":"どうしてって……メモに書いてあったから……。\nあれっ、ちがうの？","zh":"你问为什么……因为便签上写着嘛……\n咦，难道不对吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"8e71b1f2937689b23cad7b4266494807b7cff4cb1d147ca8b14c518d81920ccf","ja":"行き違いがあったみたいね。\n今日は最初に、TV用の衣装を合わせるんですって。","zh":"好像有些误会呢。\n说是今天首先要试穿电视节目用的服装。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"61a19a63c29543b5936448abaf36718bae4e63c01b20d8a101a97fdc1d131fda","ja":"じゃあ、レッスンルームっていうのも、\nかんちがいだったんだ！","zh":"那么，练习室什么的，\n也是我搞错了啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"3ecd2d44cd33d6210d09aee5973a443975ce9ee294afda87b03f02f697fb6a42","ja":"それと……環はなんで、\n美希のマクラなんて持ってるんだ？","zh":"还有……环为什么会拿着\n美希的枕头啊？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"35cb049cf549aba71629763bdd8bdd3decb4322f903b19d11f8b48d64f6c6d6a","ja":"事務室の、マとクがつくものを持ってきてって\nメモにあったから、マクラかなって……。","zh":"便签上写着把办公室里带“マ”和“ク”的东西拿过来，\n所以我想是不是枕头（マクラ）……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"f5829b047a646c592fa72113518141d396e83ecdf9a9b57bcb64b972f27e55fc","ja":"そう言えば、●●●●プロデューサーさんが、\nマイクを修理に出すって、言ってたわね……。","zh":"说起来，●●●●制作人说过\n要把麦克风送去修理呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"1c6148ced67c6b96f1766622981fdd71f8c04098e68f14efa602a51f438469ff","ja":"レッスンルームにあるのを、事務室に持って行って\nおいて、ってことなんじゃないかしら？","zh":"是不是指把练习室里的东西，\n拿到办公室放好呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"316b2f68345ac6c471b3270e6853627234a5946d34b79d96e00624c91262eed5","ja":"マイクが、マクラ……。\nもう、間違いばっかり……。","zh":"话筒变成了枕头……\n真是的，全搞错了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"00995af2d2bfd7af603400d8012416b560aab960c33ae75efdc344a4cf29c5e1","ja":"そんなに気にしないで。とってもかわいらしい\n間違いで、なんだか癒されちゃったから♪","zh":"用不着那么在意的。那个失误特别可爱，\n反而让人感到挺治愈的呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[58].text","source_sha256":"802b2b7e8ad369f0971f1e8aee4af0e2c14fbfe47d2094208a31c132624f7cae","ja":"そうそう。間違いは誰にだってあるしな。","zh":"就是说啊。谁都会犯错嘛。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[59].text","source_sha256":"df7358b9a0f3bf2fb67f862b01428340472acff34ce0e03a3eef80c9416d0675","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーが戻ってくるころだし、\n気持ちを切り替えていこうぜ！","zh":"●●●●制作人也差不多该回来了，\n转换一下心情，打起精神来吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1522.unity3d","item_key":"commands[60].text","source_sha256":"973daaf8b199f4a9ac8439741d0f4ac43e3a22abb5e3ec8d4daed511a6c9aecd","ja":"はーい……うう～……。","zh":"好——……呜呜～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
